sequenceDiagram
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as LLMBatchGatewayReconciler
    participant Helm as HelmRenderer<br/>(in-memory)
    participant SecSync as Secret Sync
    participant OSConfig as OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(monitoring namespace)
    participant MetricsEP as Metrics Endpoint<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(220, 235, 255)
    note over K8sAPI, Helm: Flow 1: LLMBatchGateway Reconciliation
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: LLMBatchGateway CR changed
    Operator->>K8sAPI: GET LLMBatchGateway CR<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    alt Cross-namespace secret configured
        Operator->>SecSync: Resolve cross-namespace secret
        SecSync->>K8sAPI: List ReferenceGrants in source namespace<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>SecSync: ReferenceGrant found
        SecSync->>K8sAPI: GET Secret from source namespace<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        SecSync->>K8sAPI: Create/Patch Secret in CR namespace<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    end
    Operator->>Helm: specToHelmValues() + Render charts
    Helm-->>Operator: []unstructured.Unstructured objects
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply rendered objects<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    note right of K8sAPI: Deployments, Services,<br/>ConfigMaps, HTTPRoutes,<br/>Certificates, ServiceMonitors...
    Operator->>K8sAPI: List resources by GVK for orphan cleanup<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Patch LLMBatchGateway status<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
    note over K8sAPI, OSConfig: Flow 2: TLS Profile Bootstrap
    Operator->>K8sAPI: GET config.openshift.io/APIServer<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Cluster TLS profile (cipher suites, min version)
    note right of Operator: Falls back to Intermediate<br/>on non-OpenShift or errors
    Operator->>MetricsEP: Configure TLS with cluster profile
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch config.openshift.io/APIServer<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    note right of Operator: SecurityProfileWatcher triggers<br/>graceful restart on changes
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
    note over Prometheus, MetricsEP: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping
    Prometheus->>MetricsEP: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer token
    MetricsEP->>K8sAPI: TokenReview (validate bearer token)<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>MetricsEP: Token valid
    MetricsEP->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview (check RBAC)<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>MetricsEP: Access allowed
    MetricsEP-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
    end
